\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Descriptive reliability of the E-archive logged reward, shown separately by target. Pre-update probabilities are grouped into ten fixed equal-width bins; dots show the mean prediction and episode-weighted reward frequency. The dashed diagonal denotes perfect calibration. Whiskers are percentile 95\% intervals from 2,000 resamples of whole runs within target; bins represented by fewer than two runs have no interval. Lower strips give exact episode counts; empty bins have no estimate. Only records with positive execution counts are included. The reward marks native coverage-save events, which may include hit-count novelty; it is not independently replayed source-branch gain. Episodes have unequal energy and no verified completion flag. Nominal $N=10$; actual $n$ and episode count $m$ are shown.}}{12}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:reliability}{{4}{12}{Descriptive reliability of the E-archive logged reward, shown separately by target. Pre-update probabilities are grouped into ten fixed equal-width bins; dots show the mean prediction and episode-weighted reward frequency. The dashed diagonal denotes perfect calibration. Whiskers are percentile 95\% intervals from 2,000 resamples of whole runs within target; bins represented by fewer than two runs have no interval. Lower strips give exact episode counts; empty bins have no estimate. Only records with positive execution counts are included. The reward marks native coverage-save events, which may include hit-count novelty; it is not independently replayed source-branch gain. Episodes have unequal energy and no verified completion flag. Nominal $N=10$; actual $n$ and episode count $m$ are shown}{figure.4}{}}
