\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Observed A--E code-branch trajectories from 469 archives. Time is measured from each fuzzer\_stats start time. Lines are medians and shaded regions are interquartile ranges, computed on a five-minute grid by linear interpolation only between recorded observations. A run contributes neither before its first observation nor after its last; the actual contributing $n$ at 24 hours is shown in A--E order. The plot displays 0--24 hours without imposing a completed 24-hour campaign on interrupted runs. Full time-dependent denominators accompany the figure data; the nominal target remains $N=10$. Missing E--bftpd is omitted. Native pipeline/build comparability remains unverified; these curves are descriptive, and shaded ranges are not confidence intervals.}}{14}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:trajectories}{{5}{14}{Observed A--E code-branch trajectories from 469 archives. Time is measured from each fuzzer\_stats start time. Lines are medians and shaded regions are interquartile ranges, computed on a five-minute grid by linear interpolation only between recorded observations. A run contributes neither before its first observation nor after its last; the actual contributing $n$ at 24 hours is shown in A--E order. The plot displays 0--24 hours without imposing a completed 24-hour campaign on interrupted runs. Full time-dependent denominators accompany the figure data; the nominal target remains $N=10$. Missing E--bftpd is omitted. Native pipeline/build comparability remains unverified; these curves are descriptive, and shaded ranges are not confidence intervals}{figure.5}{}}
